    <string name="edge_aurora_title">Edge Aurora</string>
    <string name="edge_aurora_enable">Use Edge Aurora</string>
    <string name="edge_aurora_summary">Each app glows in its own color. Tap or hold to peek.</string>
    <string name="edge_aurora_instructions">Add apps or groups below. Use the selected tap or hold action to open a glow’s notification panel, expand a notification to read, and reply when the app supports it. With Tap selected, hold a glow to move it. You can also move glows in their settings preview. Pull a panel inward or tap Float to make a movable bubble; drag it back onto its glow to dock it, or onto Clear to dismiss its notifications. Edge Aurora can run alongside Edge Light and pauses automatically while GameSpace is active.</string>
